---
import DirectoryLayout from "../layouts/DirectoryLayout.astro";
import SafetyNotice from "../components/SafetyNotice.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
---

<DirectoryLayout
  heading="Legal Disclaimers & Disclosures"
  subheading="Informational directory status, recruitment disclaimers, and trademark notices."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "All Jobs", item: "/jobs" },
    { name: "Disclaimer", item: "/disclaimer" },
  ]}
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
    <section class="neo-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 bg-white">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">1. Informational Directory Status (Not an Employer)</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>{siteConfig.name} is an independent informational directory.</strong> We are not an employer, staffing agency, recruitment firm, or labor broker.
      </p>
      <p>
        Inclusion of a community in this directory does not constitute an endorsement, warranty of employment, or verification of hiring claims made by third parties. We do not guarantee job placement, interview opportunities, or the validity of job vacancies shared within external chat groups.
      </p>
      <SafetyNotice type="job-warning" />
    </section>

    <section class="neo-card-yellow p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">2. No Payment for Employment</h2>
      <p class="font-bold text-black">
        Under no circumstances should any user pay money to apply for a job, obtain an interview, purchase mandatory training materials, or deposit cryptocurrency into third-party task platforms. Any group demanding upfront fees is likely fraudulent.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 bg-white">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">3. Trademark Notice & Non-Affiliation</h2>
      <p>
        Telegram, WhatsApp, Discord, Meta Platforms Inc., and any employer brand names, logos, or trademarks referenced on this website are the property of their respective trademark holders.
      </p>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.name} is an independent third-party index. Reference to these names and trademarks does not imply endorsement, affiliation, or sponsorship by their respective owners.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-card-mint p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">4. External Links & User Vigilance</h2>
      <p>
        We have no direct control over the messages, links, files, or moderation practices within external third-party chat groups. Users access external communities at their own discretion and must maintain independent vigilance.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</DirectoryLayout>
